# FitOutLab 200k Script Bundle — Capsule Logic

![FitOut Lab Interior Logo](image1)

**Domain:** `fitoutlab.app`  
**Integration:** Nested under `designfitout.com` with shared Firebase backend  
**Role:** Tool-facing capsule for architecture & interior design workflows

---

## 1. Visual Spec Builder

**Purpose:**  
Assemble specs visually, tag CEU content, export as PDF/JSON

**Stack:**  
- React + react-beautiful-dnd  
- Firebase Firestore + Storage

**Scripts:**  
- `specBuilder.js` – PDF/JSON generator  
- `drawingSync.js` – Firestore sync  
- ACL token for designer/consultant roles

---

## 2. Client Dashboard

**Purpose:**  
Secure portal for capsule status, dispatch logs, spec downloads

**Stack:**  
- React + Firebase Auth  
- Firestore: `clients/{clientId}`

**Scripts:**  
- `dashboardExport.js` – PDF generator  
- ACL token for client/enterprise roles

**Features:**  
- Timeline view  
- Spec download history  
- Dispatch logs  
- Engagement summary

---

## 3. Realtime Capsule Trace

**Purpose:**  
Live capsule progress visualization

**Stack:**  
- React Timeline UI  
- Firebase Realtime DB or Firestore listeners

**Scripts:**  
- `capsuleTrace.js` – PDF/dashboard export  
- Events: `designStarted`, `specApproved`, `dispatchTriggered`, `exportCompleted`

---

## 4. Multi-language Support

**Purpose:**  
Arabic + English toggle across public pages

**Stack:**  
- React Intl or Firebase i18n  
- JSON files: `en.json`, `ar.json`

**Scripts:**  
- SEO schema per language  
- Translated `sitemap.xml`  
- RTL layout for Arabic

---

## 5. Design-to-Dispatch Sync

**Purpose:**  
Link SpecLab selections to FIX24 dispatch logic

**Stack:**  
- SpecLab UI + Firestore trigger

**Scripts:**  
- `dispatchSync.js` – Creates dispatch ticket from spec  
- `dispatchExport.js` – PDF export  
- Capsule trace updated with sync event

---

## Drawing & Symbol Automation

**AutoCAD:**  
- `symbol_injector.lsp` – Loads standard symbols  
- `boq_extractor.lsp` – Parses layers/blocks for quantities  
- `2d3d_switch.lsp` – Converts 2D to 3D views

**SketchUp:**  
- `component_loader.rb` – Loads reusable components  
- `boq_parser.rb` – Extracts dimensions/counts  
- `renderQueue.rb` – Batch renders with V-Ray/Enscape

**FitOutLab:**  
- `capsule_draw.js` – Converts JSON specs to SVG/DXF

---

## Quotation & Price List Automation

**Scripts:**  
- `quoteGenerator.js` – Builds quotations from BOQ + price list  
- `quoteExport.js` – PDF export  
- `priceUpdater.js` – Syncs prices from CSV/daily input  
- `priceManager.jsx` – Admin UI for edits  
- `priceHistory.js` – Tracks changes over time

---

## Rendering & 2D/3D Automation

**Scripts:**  
- `renderTrigger.js` – Triggers rendering from specs  
- Firebase Storage: `renders/{projectId}`

---

## Access Control & Roles

**Roles:**  
- Designer: Spec Builder, Rendering  
- Estimator: BOQ + Quotation  
- Admin: Price List Manager  
- Client: Dashboard, Quotation Viewer  
- Technician: Dispatch Logs, Capsule Trace

**ACL tokens:** Issued via `issueToken.js`

---

